- kpi_* keys → key_messages as standalone metrics (e.g. "ARR reached $42.8M (+18% QoQ)")
- chart_* keys → key_messages as data series (e.g. "Revenue by quarter: Q1 $28.4M, Q2 $31.2M...")
- table_* keys → key_messages as record sets (e.g. "Enterprise $28.1M +22% | Mid-Market $10.4M +14%")
- bullets → key_messages as qualitative insights
- timeline_items → key_messages as sequential events
- flow_steps → key_messages as process steps
